
How to transform Graphics to G1 Characters
=============================================================================
Drawing graphics in G1 characters is not so easy if you do it from
scratch. It is better to use a systematic method that is also suitable
for automation with a computer program. The following illustrates a method
how to transform a graphic to G1 graphic characters.


